#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The file\n"
"%1\n"
"has been modified.\n"
"Do you want to upload the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Pela\n"
"%1\n"
"hate guherandin.\n"
"Tu dixwazî guherandinan bar bikî?"

